  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIVAIDS2008-2009</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">hivaids 2008-2009</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida har sedan mitten av 1980-talet givit st&#xf6;d till HIV-relaterad forskning genom bilaterala forskningssamarbeten, int. organisationer samt det s&#xe4;rskilda programmet f&#xf6;r HIV-forskning. Syftet med det programmet &#xe4;r att rikta svensk frontforskning mot HIV. Med anledning av HIV-pandemins utveckling har Sida utlyst fortsatt forskningsst&#xf6;d. Ans&#xf6;kningarna har utv&#xe4;rderats av en internationell expertpanel.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since the mid-1980s, Sida has supported HIV research within bilateral research cooperation programmes, international research organisations, and through this special programme called programme for research on HIV. The purpose of this programme is to direct Swedish frontline researchers towards HIV. These applications have been reviewed by an international expert group.</narrative>
  </description>
